one risky bet",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a scholarship portfolio, not one risky bet"}],[["$","p","Divide your shortlist into opportunities with different selection models. A government leadership scholarship, a university merit award and a research assistantship may judge different strengths. This reduces dependence on one result and helps you reuse verified evidence without sending identical applications.",{"children":"Divide your shortlist into opportunities with different selection models. A government leadership scholarship, a university merit award and a research assistantship may judge different strengths. This reduces dependence on one result and helps you reuse verified evidence without sending identical applications."}],"$L22"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29"]}]
